{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41979","headline":"晋陵罢任寓居依韵和陈锐秀才见寄 · 李中","name":"晋陵罢任寓居依韵和陈锐秀才见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掩门三径莓苔绿，车马谁来陋巷间。\n卧弃琴书公干病，笑迎风月步兵闲。\n当秋每谢蛬清耳，渐老多慙酒借颜。\n济物未能伸一术，敢於明代爱青山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}